{"id":"U04","title":"Reading: A Vital Part of My Life","titleZh":"阅读：我生命中至关重要的一部分","paras":[{"id":"U04-P1","sentences":[{"id":"U04-P1-S1","hard":true,"text":"I must have always known reading was very important because the first memories I have as a child deal with books."},{"id":"U04-P1-S2","hard":false,"text":"There was not one night that I don't remember Mom reading me a storybook by my bedside."},{"id":"U04-P1-S3","hard":false,"text":"I was extremely inspired by the elegant way the words sounded."}],"zh":"我一定从小就明白阅读非常重要，因为我童年最早的记忆都与书有关。我记得每一个夜晚，妈妈都在我的床边为我读故事书。那些文字优美的发音深深地启发了我。"},{"id":"U04-P2","sentences":[{"id":"U04-P2-S1","hard":false,"text":"I always wanted to know what my mom was reading."},{"id":"U04-P2-S2","hard":true,"text":"Hearing Mom say, \"I can't believe what's printed in the newspaper this morning,\" made me want to grab it out of her hands and read it myself."},{"id":"U04-P2-S3","hard":false,"text":"I wanted to be like my mom and know all of the things she knew."},{"id":"U04-P2-S4","hard":false,"text":"So I carried around a book, and each night, just to be like her, I would pretend to be reading."}],"zh":"我一直想知道妈妈在读什么。听到妈妈说\"我不敢相信今天早上报纸上印的内容\"，我就想把报纸从她手里抢过来自己读。我想成为妈妈那样的人，知道她知道的每一件事。于是我随身带着一本书，每天晚上，为了像她一样，我会假装在阅读。"},{"id":"U04-P3","sentences":[{"id":"U04-P3-S1","hard":false,"text":"This is how everyone learned to read."},{"id":"U04-P3-S2","hard":false,"text":"We would start off with sentences, then paragraphs, and then stories."},{"id":"U04-P3-S3","hard":true,"text":"It seemed an unending journey, but even as a six-year-old girl I realized that knowing how to read could open many doors."},{"id":"U04-P3-S4","hard":false,"text":"When Mom said, \"The C-A-N-D-Y is hidden on the top shelf,\" I knew where the candy was."},{"id":"U04-P3-S5","hard":false,"text":"My progress in reading raised my curiosity, and I wanted to know everything."},{"id":"U04-P3-S6","hard":true,"text":"I often found myself telling my mom to drive more slowly, so that I could read all of the road signs we passed."}],"zh":"这就是每个人学习阅读的方式。我们从句子开始，然后是段落，接着是故事。这似乎是一段永无止境的旅程，但即使是作为一个六岁的女孩，我也意识到懂得阅读可以打开许多扇门。当妈妈说\"C-A-N-D-Y藏在最上面的架子上\"时，我就知道糖果在哪里了。我在阅读上的进步激发了我的好奇心，我想知道一切。我经常发现自己让妈妈开慢一点，这样我就能读完我们经过的所有路标。"},{"id":"U04-P4","sentences":[{"id":"U04-P4-S1","hard":false,"text":"Most of my reading through primary, middle and high school was factual reading."},{"id":"U04-P4-S2","hard":false,"text":"I read for knowledge, and to make A's on my tests."},{"id":"U04-P4-S3","hard":true,"text":"Occasionally, I would read a novel that was assigned, but I didn't enjoy this type of reading."},{"id":"U04-P4-S4","hard":false,"text":"I liked facts, things that are concrete."},{"id":"U04-P4-S5","hard":false,"text":"I thought anything abstract left too much room for argument."}],"zh":"我在小学、初中和高中期间的大部分阅读都是事实性阅读。我为了获取知识而阅读，为了在考试中拿A。偶尔，我会读一本指定的小说，但我不喜欢这种阅读类型。我喜欢事实，喜欢具体的东西。我认为任何抽象的东西都留下了太多争论的余地。"},{"id":"U04-P5","sentences":[{"id":"U04-P5-S1","hard":true,"text":"Yet, now that I'm growing and the world I once knew as being so simple is becoming more complex, I find myself needing a way to escape."},{"id":"U04-P5-S2","hard":true,"text":"By opening a novel, I can leave behind my burdens and enter into a wonderful and mysterious world where I am now a new character."},{"id":"U04-P5-S3","hard":false,"text":"In these worlds I can become anyone."},{"id":"U04-P5-S4","hard":false,"text":"I don't have to write down what happened or what technique the author was using when he or she wrote this."},{"id":"U04-P5-S5","hard":false,"text":"I just read to relax."}],"zh":"然而，随着我不断成长，我曾经认为如此简单的世界正变得越来越复杂，我发现自己需要一种逃避的方式。打开一本小说，我可以放下自己的负担，进入一个奇妙而神秘的世界，在那里我现在是一个全新的角色。在这些世界里，我可以成为任何人。我不必记下发生了什么，也不必记下作者写这部作品时使用了什么技巧。我只是为了放松而阅读。"},{"id":"U04-P6","sentences":[{"id":"U04-P6-S1","hard":false,"text":"We're taught to read because it's necessary for much of human understanding."},{"id":"U04-P6-S2","hard":false,"text":"Reading is a vital part of my life."},{"id":"U04-P6-S3","hard":false,"text":"Reading satisfies my desire to keep learning."},{"id":"U04-P6-S4","hard":true,"text":"And I've found that the possibilities that lie within books are limitless."}],"zh":"我们被教导要阅读，因为阅读对于人类的许多理解都是必要的。阅读是我生命中至关重要的一部分。阅读满足了我不断学习的渴望。我发现书中蕴含的可能性是无限的。"}],"words":[{"id":"U04-W01","lemma":"memory","surface":"memories","pos":"n.","zh":"记忆; 回忆","sent":"U04-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"childhood memories","zh":"童年记忆"},{"en":"in memory of","zh":"纪念"}]},{"id":"U04-W02","lemma":"deal with","surface":"deal with","pos":"phr. v.","zh":"处理; 涉及; 与...有关","sent":"U04-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"deal with problems","zh":"处理问题"},{"en":"deal with stress","zh":"应对压力"}]},{"id":"U04-W03","lemma":"remember","surface":"remember","pos":"v.","zh":"记得; 记住","sent":"U04-P1-S2","phrases":[{"en":"remember to do sth.","zh":"记得去做某事"},{"en":"remember doing sth.","zh":"记得做过某事"}]},{"id":"U04-W04","lemma":"extremely","surface":"extremely","pos":"adv.","zh":"极其; 非常","sent":"U04-P1-S3","phrases":[{"en":"extremely important","zh":"极其重要"}]},{"id":"U04-W05","lemma":"inspire","surface":"inspired","pos":"v.","zh":"启发; 激励; 鼓舞","sent":"U04-P1-S3","phrases":[{"en":"be inspired by","zh":"受到...的启发"},{"en":"inspire sb. to do sth.","zh":"激励某人做某事"}]},{"id":"U04-W06","lemma":"elegant","surface":"elegant","pos":"adj.","zh":"优美的; 优雅的; 高雅的","sent":"U04-P1-S3","phrases":[{"en":"elegant design","zh":"优雅的设计"}]},{"id":"U04-W07","lemma":"print","surface":"printed","pos":"v.","zh":"印刷; 打印; 刊登","sent":"U04-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"print out","zh":"打印出来"},{"en":"in print","zh":"已出版; 在印刷中"}]},{"id":"U04-W08","lemma":"grab","surface":"grab","pos":"v.","zh":"抓取; 夺取; 赶紧做","sent":"U04-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"grab hold of","zh":"抓住"},{"en":"grab a bite","zh":"赶紧吃点东西"}]},{"id":"U04-W09","lemma":"pretend","surface":"pretend","pos":"v.","zh":"假装; 佯装","sent":"U04-P2-S4","phrases":[{"en":"pretend to do sth.","zh":"假装做某事"}]},{"id":"U04-W10","lemma":"start off","surface":"start off","pos":"phr. v.","zh":"以...开始; 出发","sent":"U04-P3-S2","phrases":[{"en":"start off with","zh":"以...开始"}]},{"id":"U04-W11","lemma":"sentence","surface":"sentences","pos":"n.","zh":"句子; 判决","sent":"U04-P3-S2","phrases":[{"en":"make a sentence","zh":"造句"},{"en":"life sentence","zh":"终身监禁"}]},{"id":"U04-W12","lemma":"paragraph","surface":"paragraphs","pos":"n.","zh":"段落","sent":"U04-P3-S2","phrases":[{"en":"opening paragraph","zh":"开篇段落"}]},{"id":"U04-W13","lemma":"unending","surface":"unending","pos":"adj.","zh":"无止境的; 无尽的","sent":"U04-P3-S3","phrases":[{"en":"unending journey","zh":"无止境的旅程"}]},{"id":"U04-W14","lemma":"journey","surface":"journey","pos":"n.","zh":"旅程; 行程; 历程","sent":"U04-P3-S3","phrases":[{"en":"go on a journey","zh":"去旅行"},{"en":"life journey","zh":"人生旅程"}]},{"id":"U04-W15","lemma":"realize","surface":"realized","pos":"v.","zh":"意识到; 实现","sent":"U04-P3-S3","phrases":[{"en":"realize one's dream","zh":"实现某人的梦想"}]},{"id":"U04-W16","lemma":"hide","surface":"hidden","pos":"v.","zh":"隐藏; 躲藏","sent":"U04-P3-S4","phrases":[{"en":"hide from","zh":"躲避"},{"en":"hide away","zh":"躲藏起来"}]},{"id":"U04-W17","lemma":"shelf","surface":"shelf","pos":"n.","zh":"架子; 搁板","sent":"U04-P3-S4","phrases":[{"en":"on the shelf","zh":"在架子上; 搁置"}]},{"id":"U04-W18","lemma":"candy","surface":"candy","pos":"n.","zh":"糖果","sent":"U04-P3-S4","phrases":[{"en":"a piece of candy","zh":"一块糖果"}]},{"id":"U04-W19","lemma":"progress","surface":"progress","pos":"n. / v.","zh":"n. 进步; 进展 v. 前进; 进步","sent":"U04-P3-S5","phrases":[{"en":"make progress","zh":"取得进步"},{"en":"in progress","zh":"在进行中"}]},{"id":"U04-W20","lemma":"raise","surface":"raised","pos":"v.","zh":"提高; 举起; 筹集; 养育","sent":"U04-P3-S5","phrases":[{"en":"raise money","zh":"筹款"},{"en":"raise awareness","zh":"提高意识"}]},{"id":"U04-W21","lemma":"curiosity","surface":"curiosity","pos":"n.","zh":"好奇心; 求知欲","sent":"U04-P3-S5","phrases":[{"en":"out of curiosity","zh":"出于好奇"}]},{"id":"U04-W22","lemma":"sign","surface":"signs","pos":"n.","zh":"标志; 指示牌; 迹象; 符号","sent":"U04-P3-S6","phrases":[{"en":"road signs","zh":"路标"},{"en":"traffic signs","zh":"交通标志"}]},{"id":"U04-W23","lemma":"primary","surface":"primary","pos":"adj.","zh":"小学的; 初级的; 首要的","sent":"U04-P4-S1","phrases":[{"en":"primary school","zh":"小学"},{"en":"primary education","zh":"初等教育"}]},{"id":"U04-W24","lemma":"factual","surface":"factual","pos":"adj.","zh":"事实的; 真实的","sent":"U04-P4-S1","phrases":[{"en":"factual reading","zh":"事实性阅读"}]},{"id":"U04-W25","lemma":"knowledge","surface":"knowledge","pos":"n.","zh":"知识; 学问","sent":"U04-P4-S2","phrases":[{"en":"acquire knowledge","zh":"获取知识"},{"en":"to one's knowledge","zh":"据某人所知"}]},{"id":"U04-W26","lemma":"occasionally","surface":"Occasionally","pos":"adv.","zh":"偶尔; 间或","sent":"U04-P4-S3","phrases":[{"en":"occasionally visit","zh":"偶尔拜访"}]},{"id":"U04-W27","lemma":"novel","surface":"novel","pos":"n.","zh":"小说","sent":"U04-P4-S3","phrases":[{"en":"write a novel","zh":"写小说"},{"en":"historical novel","zh":"历史小说"}]},{"id":"U04-W28","lemma":"assign","surface":"assigned","pos":"v.","zh":"分配; 布置; 指定","sent":"U04-P4-S3","phrases":[{"en":"assign homework","zh":"布置作业"},{"en":"assign a task","zh":"分配任务"}]},{"id":"U04-W29","lemma":"type","surface":"type","pos":"n. / v.","zh":"n. 类型; 种类 v. 打字","sent":"U04-P4-S3","phrases":[{"en":"a type of","zh":"一种..."},{"en":"blood type","zh":"血型"}]},{"id":"U04-W30","lemma":"concrete","surface":"concrete","pos":"adj.","zh":"具体的; 有形的; 混凝土的","sent":"U04-P4-S4","phrases":[{"en":"concrete evidence","zh":"具体证据"}]},{"id":"U04-W31","lemma":"abstract","surface":"abstract","pos":"adj. / n.","zh":"adj. 抽象的 n. 摘要; 抽象概念","sent":"U04-P4-S5","phrases":[{"en":"abstract art","zh":"抽象艺术"},{"en":"in the abstract","zh":"抽象地; 理论上"}]},{"id":"U04-W32","lemma":"room","surface":"room","pos":"n.","zh":"房间; 空间; 余地","sent":"U04-P4-S5","phrases":[{"en":"make room for","zh":"为...腾出空间"},{"en":"there is room for","zh":"有...的余地"}]},{"id":"U04-W33","lemma":"argument","surface":"argument","pos":"n.","zh":"争论; 论点; 论据","sent":"U04-P4-S5","phrases":[{"en":"have an argument","zh":"发生争论"},{"en":"strong argument","zh":"有力的论据"}]},{"id":"U04-W34","lemma":"simple","surface":"simple","pos":"adj.","zh":"简单的; 朴素的","sent":"U04-P5-S1","phrases":[{"en":"simple life","zh":"简单的生活"}]},{"id":"U04-W35","lemma":"complex","surface":"complex","pos":"adj. / n.","zh":"adj. 复杂的 n. 综合体; 情结","sent":"U04-P5-S1","phrases":[{"en":"complex problem","zh":"复杂的问题"},{"en":"sports complex","zh":"体育综合体"}]},{"id":"U04-W36","lemma":"escape","surface":"escape","pos":"v. / n.","zh":"v. 逃避; 逃跑 n. 逃避; 逃跑","sent":"U04-P5-S1","phrases":[{"en":"escape from","zh":"从...逃跑"},{"en":"narrow escape","zh":"九死一生"}]},{"id":"U04-W37","lemma":"burden","surface":"burdens","pos":"n.","zh":"负担; 重担","sent":"U04-P5-S2","phrases":[{"en":"heavy burden","zh":"沉重的负担"},{"en":"bear the burden","zh":"承担负担"}]},{"id":"U04-W38","lemma":"wonderful","surface":"wonderful","pos":"adj.","zh":"奇妙的; 精彩的; 极好的","sent":"U04-P5-S2","phrases":[{"en":"wonderful world","zh":"精彩的世界"}]},{"id":"U04-W39","lemma":"mysterious","surface":"mysterious","pos":"adj.","zh":"神秘的; 不可思议的","sent":"U04-P5-S2","phrases":[{"en":"mysterious world","zh":"神秘的世界"}]},{"id":"U04-W40","lemma":"character","surface":"character","pos":"n.","zh":"角色; 性格; 文字; 特点","sent":"U04-P5-S2","phrases":[{"en":"main character","zh":"主角"},{"en":"in character","zh":"符合性格"}]},{"id":"U04-W41","lemma":"technique","surface":"technique","pos":"n.","zh":"技巧; 方法; 技术","sent":"U04-P5-S4","phrases":[{"en":"writing technique","zh":"写作技巧"}]},{"id":"U04-W42","lemma":"relax","surface":"relax","pos":"v.","zh":"放松; 休息","sent":"U04-P5-S5","phrases":[{"en":"relax oneself","zh":"放松自己"},{"en":"sit back and relax","zh":"坐下来放松"}]},{"id":"U04-W43","lemma":"vital","surface":"vital","pos":"adj.","zh":"至关重要的; 必不可少的","sent":"U04-P6-S2","phrases":[{"en":"vital part","zh":"至关重要的部分"},{"en":"vital to","zh":"对...至关重要"}]},{"id":"U04-W44","lemma":"satisfy","surface":"satisfies","pos":"v.","zh":"满足; 使满意","sent":"U04-P6-S3","phrases":[{"en":"satisfy one's desire","zh":"满足某人的愿望"},{"en":"be satisfied with","zh":"对...满意"}]},{"id":"U04-W45","lemma":"desire","surface":"desire","pos":"n. / v.","zh":"n. 渴望; 愿望 v. 渴望; 希望","sent":"U04-P6-S3","phrases":[{"en":"a desire to learn","zh":"学习的渴望"},{"en":"have a desire for","zh":"渴望得到..."}]},{"id":"U04-W46","lemma":"possibility","surface":"possibilities","pos":"n.","zh":"可能性; 可能的事","sent":"U04-P6-S4","phrases":[{"en":"endless possibilities","zh":"无限的可能性"},{"en":"possibility of","zh":"...的可能性"}]},{"id":"U04-W47","lemma":"limitless","surface":"limitless","pos":"adj.","zh":"无限的; 无止境的","sent":"U04-P6-S4","phrases":[{"en":"limitless possibilities","zh":"无限的可能性"}]}],"_v":1786413566727}